</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Deep Thy sorrow then, Lord Jesus,</l><l>Deeper far than thought can reach;</l><l>Grief intense and suff’rings holy,</l><l>Far beyond all tongues to teach.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>None could follow there, blest Savior,</l><l>When redemption’s work was done;</l><l>For those suff’rings, deep, unfathomed,</l><l>Were, Lord Jesus, Thine alone!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Thou didst measure then sin’s distance,</l><l>Darkness, wrath and curse were Thine;</l><l>Man-betrayed, by God forsaken;</l><l>Thus we learn Thy love divine!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
